# 🧩 Troubleshooting

### User Cannot Access Application

Verify:

- User has been assigned to the application.
- Group membership is correct.
- Application assignment is required.

### SSO Not Working

Verify:

- SAML/OIDC configuration is correct.
- Sign-On URL is configured correctly.
- Required certificates are valid.

### Application Not Visible

Verify:

- User assignment exists.
- Group assignment exists.
- Application has been enabled.

